      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just to clarify, is there no way to change the binding \"getMappedRange\" function signature or it\u0027s implementation? \n\nMy plan was passing the JS object through the binding getMappedRange function \n```\nauto result \u003d impl-\u003egetMappedRange(info.Env(), info.This().As\u003cNapi::Object\u003e(), std::get\u003c0\u003e(args), std::get\u003c1\u003e(args));\n```\n\nAlso, I couldn’t find any reference to Wrapper::For in Dawn’s codebase.",
